N5008 [temp.variadic]/5: a pack expansion whose pattern is a function
type naming the pack inside a parameter position, F(decay<Bs>::type...),
must be expanded per element (previously only a bare Bs... was), and the
expanded function type must be type-checked so the partial specialization
B<F(A...)> matches ([temp.arg.type]/1).  The shape of libstdc++'s
_Bind_helper / std::bind result type.
